 **Numbered Steps:**
 
-1.  **Generate Triangle Primitives:** For each triangle $f_A \in F_A$ and each vertex $v_B \in V_B$, compute the triangle primitive $f_A \oplus v_B$. The vertices of this primitive are $\{v_A + v_B \mid v_A \in f_A\}$ [S1].
